Note on the VisA dataset

This repository also refers to the VisA dataset (Zou et al., ECCV 2022),
which is distributed separately under CC BY 4.0 by Amazon Science.
VisA images are NOT included in this repository; see scripts/ for how to
download them from the AWS Open Data Registry.
